  "title": "Quick Eggplant Parmesan",
  "description": "This quick eggplant recipe uses the microwave and stovetop to make a simple and tasty Italian meal with jarred spaghetti sauce in just 15 minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "jen"
  ],
